<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks fall to 205,557.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks fall to 205,557.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of May 23 totaled 205,557 bales, down from 211,687 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 534 bales issued, 1,530 bales awaiting review, 6,664 cancellations, and 5,776 decertification orders.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
